    <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:14px;">DFx &amp; JDM Collaboration · DFx / DFM</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">Design for Excellence (DFx / DFM)</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Hana’s DFx process reviews a design against manufacturing, test and reliability requirements before it reaches production. The objective is to identify issues while changes can still be made efficiently, rather than during first build or production ramp.</p>
    <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:407px;"><img src="/images/photos/cap-dfx-jdm-dfx-dfm-hero.webp" alt="DFM comparison showing insufficient pad spacing versus DFM-compliant spacing" style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;" /></div>
    <div class="hana-spec-block" style="margin-top:18px;"><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Manufacturability</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">DFM</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Testability</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">DFT</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Reliability</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">DFR</div></div><div class="hana-spec-item"><div class="hana-spec-label" style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Before NPI</div><div class="hana-spec-value" style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:22px;">Early</div></div></div>
  </div></div></div>
<div class="sc-pillars-band" data-hana-bg="wafer" data-variant="light" data-accent="" data-fade="none" style="background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f5f7fa 35%,#d8e6f3 100%);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="cap-section cap-section--band"><div style="margin-bottom:64px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Capability overview</h2><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;max-width:640px;margin:10px 0 0;">The review considers manufacturability, testability and reliability, with findings documented and discussed with the customer engineering team before NPI.</p></div>
