<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:44px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Why run DFx / DFM with Hana</h2></div><div class="why-grid"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);padding:32px 30px;background:linear-gradient(152deg,#155F9B 0%,#0E4A7C 46%,#0A3860 100%);border:none;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px;"><img src="~/images/hana-mark-white.svg" alt="" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:block;flex:none;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.24);"></span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:#7EC8FF;margin-bottom:10px;">Earlier engineering input</div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:#fff;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Resolve manufacturing issues before the first build</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.84);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">Early DFx review can identify footprint, sourcing, inspection, test and process issues before tooling and NPI. This reduces the likelihood of design changes being discovered during first article or production ramp.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Issues caught before tooling and NPI</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Fewer surprises on first article</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">Manufacturability, test and reliability together</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);"><span style="color:#7EC8FF;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);line-height:1.55;">A documented engineering review</span></li></ul></div><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);padding:32px 30px;background:linear-gradient(152deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#E5EEF5 58%,#D8E6F1 100%);border:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px;"><img src="~/images/hana-mark.svg" alt="" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:block;flex:none;"><span style="flex:1;height:1px;background:#BFD4E4;"></span></div><div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:var(--hana-blue);margin-bottom:10px;">Engineering collaboration</div><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:23px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Manufacturing engineers working directly with your design team</h3><p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;">DFx review is carried out with engineers close to the manufacturing process. This allows design intent, process requirements and practical manufacturing constraints to be considered together rather than treated as a simple compliance check.</p><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Process engineers work with your team</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Practical options for identified issues</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">DFM feeds directly into NPI</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:16px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid #CBDCEA;border-bottom:1px solid #CBDCEA;"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">NDA signed before any CAD is shared</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div>
